\glossaryentry{economies of scale?\glossaryentryfield{eos}{\glsnamefont{economies of scale}}{First of the two forms of `increasing returns' used in the thesis: a larger input into a production function means a more-than-proportional increase in output.}{\relax }|setentrycounter[]{page}\glsnumberformat}{230}
