\glossaryentry{representative agent?\glossaryentryfield{repag}{\glsnamefont{representative agent}}{Term used to describe the use of a single agent as a stand-in for all agents in an economic model. The `core model' uses this.}{\relax }|setentrycounter[]{page}\glsnumberformat}{233}
